bin/jen-machine, the launcher, is jen's, under the Apache License 2.0 in
LICENSE.

bin/docker is Docker's command-line client for macOS, from
https://download.docker.com/mac/static/stable/aarch64/, under the Apache
License 2.0.

machine/ is a Linux system built from Alpine Linux packages, each under its
own license: among them the Linux kernel and BusyBox under the GNU General
Public License version 2, and Docker Engine, containerd and runc under the
Apache License 2.0. The system lists every package with its version and
license in /lib/apk/db/installed. Their sources are Alpine's, at
https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports, and how jen builds the system
from them is in https://github.com/reveer-ai/jen, under src/machine/.
